// part.type == "text": skip when messageRoles[messageID]=="user"; completeActiveReasoning; partTypes.set(id,"text"); if hasCompletedCurrentAssistantMessage startNewOpencodeSegment; on growth: partTexts.set, assistantText += delta, hasStartedAgentMessage=true, if !hasStartedCurrentAssistantMessage push item/started agentMessage, currentAssistantText += delta, push item/agentMessage/delta
