// statusCode = err.status ?? err.statusCode ?? err.data.status ?? err.data.statusCode; transient/fatal classification as in retry case
// if transient && !exhausted && !fatal: recordOpencodeUpstreamIssue(...); if attempts < MAX break; else fall through
// status=failed; complete reasoning/assistant as failed; push turn/failed {error: errorMsg}
